 ...dsi-to-lvds-v2-panel-cap-touch-10inch.dtso | 153 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 158 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/k3-am69-aquila-dsi-to-lvds-v2-panel-cap-touch-10inch.dtso

